上节课的mcpserver配置后会出现对应的server，但是本课的这个配置{
  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {
    &quot;achievement&quot;: {
      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;uv&quot;,
      &quot;args&quot;: [
        &quot;run&quot;,
        &quot;--with&quot;,
        &quot;mcp[cli]&quot;,
        &quot;--with-editable&quot;,
        &quot;D:\\workspace\\python\\mcp-test\\achievement&quot;,
        &quot;mcp&quot;,
        &quot;run&quot;,
        &quot;D:\\workspace\\python\\mcp-test\\achievement\\server.py&quot;
      ]
    }
  }
}在mac系统的vscode中添加后不提示server组件

